# 🚀 Day 33 – Media Integrity Analyzer

## 📌 Challenge Overview

Day 33 focused on building **Media Integrity Analyzer**, an interactive educational web application powered by **Claude AI**. The goal of this project is to teach **media literacy through guided discovery**, enabling users to recognize misleading headlines, emotional manipulation, and audience targeting rather than simply consuming online content.

The application combines **interactive learning, critical thinking, prompt engineering, and frontend development** into a modern, engaging experience.

---

# 📰 Project Description

**Media Integrity Analyzer**

A single-file HTML application that helps users analyze news headlines and social media content through hands-on activities. Instead of testing prior knowledge, the application teaches users how to think critically by revealing insights after each challenge.

Every session generates new fictional scenarios, making the learning experience fresh and replayable.

